<script setup>
import {computed} from 'vue';
import ProductImage from './ProductImage.vue';
import {money,date,observed} from './reportFormat';
const props=defineProps({document:Object,theme:{type:String,default:'violet'}});
const doc=computed(()=>props.document);
const source=id=>doc.value.sources.find(s=>s.id===id);
</script>
<template>
<article v-if="doc" :class="['decision-report','theme-'+theme]" aria-label="完整选购决策报告">
 <header class="dr-hero"><div class="dr-brand">SMARTBUY <b>AI</b><span>PERSONAL BUYING REPORT</span></div><div class="dr-hero-body"><div><span class="dr-kicker">给下一次选择，留一份依据</span><h2>{{doc.title}}</h2><div class="dr-tags"><span>{{doc.profile.scenario}}</span><span>{{doc.selection.label}}</span><span v-if="doc.selection.is_system_choice">与系统首选一致</span><span v-else-if="doc.selection.rank">预算候选第 {{doc.selection.rank}} 名</span></div></div><ProductImage :product="doc.product"/></div><div class="dr-status" :class="doc.decision.tone"><i></i>{{doc.decision.status}}</div><h3>{{doc.product.name}}</h3><p class="dr-conclusion">{{doc.decision.conclusion}}</p><p class="dr-attention">{{doc.decision.note}}</p><div v-if="doc.system_choice&&!doc.selection.is_system_choice" class="dr-system-choice">当前系统首选：<b>{{doc.system_choice.name}}</b><span>本报告围绕你选中的产品展开。</span></div></header>
 <div class="dr-stats"><div><small>预算上限</small><b>{{money(doc.profile.budget)}}</b></div><div><small>{{doc.product.offer?.price_type||'有效报价'}}</small><b>{{money(doc.product.price)}}</b></div><div><small>{{doc.budget.remaining!=null&&doc.budget.remaining<0?'超支金额':'名义余额 · 未计配件'}}</small><b :class="{warning:doc.budget.remaining<0}">{{money(doc.budget.remaining==null?null:Math.abs(doc.budget.remaining))}}</b></div></div>
 <section class="dr-section dr-needs"><div class="dr-section-heading"><span>01</span><h3>从你的需求出发</h3><small>本次选购范围</small></div><p>{{doc.profile.needs}}</p><div class="dr-coverage"><span>{{doc.selection.eligible_count}} 款预算候选</span><span>选购参考分 {{doc.product.score}}</span><span>评分信息覆盖 {{doc.product.confidence}}%</span></div><small>参考分与信息覆盖用于说明规则和资料情况，不代表实测成绩或产品质量。</small></section>
 <section class="dr-section"><div class="dr-section-heading"><span>02</span><h3>为什么考虑这款</h3><small>需求 → 依据 → 使用意义</small></div><div class="dr-reasons"><article v-for="r in doc.reasons" :key="r.metric" :class="{unverified:!r.known}"><small>{{r.known?'有参数依据':'待确认事项'}}</small><h4>{{r.title}}</h4><b>{{r.evidence}}</b><p>{{r.meaning}}</p><details><summary>购买前多确认一步</summary><p>{{r.check}}</p><small>{{r.rule}}</small></details><a v-if="source(r.source_id)" :href="source(r.source_id).url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">[{{r.source_id}}] 参数原文 ↗</a></article></div></section>
 <section class="dr-section"><div class="dr-section-heading"><span>03</span><h3>两款怎么取舍</h3><small>先看与你有关的差别</small></div><template v-if="doc.peer"><div class="dr-pair"><article v-for="(p,i) in [doc.product,doc.peer]" :key="p.id"><ProductImage :product="p"/><div><small>{{i===0?'A · 报告对象':'B · 对比产品'}}</small><h4>{{p.name}}</h4><b>{{money(p.price)}}</b><p>{{p.budget_status}}</p></div></article></div><div class="dr-comparison-scroll"><table class="dr-comparison"><thead><tr><th>关注维度</th><th>A · {{doc.product.name}}</th><th>B · {{doc.peer.name}}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in doc.tradeoff.rows" :key="r.metric"><th>{{r.label}}</th><td v-for="(v,i) in r.values" :key="i" :class="{unknown:!r.known[i]}">{{v}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="dr-choices"><article v-for="(choice,i) in doc.tradeoff.choices" :key="choice.product_id"><strong>{{i===0?'倾向 A，如果…':'倾向 B，如果…'}}</strong><p>{{choice.when}}</p><small>{{choice.caution}}</small></article></div><p class="dr-gap">{{doc.tradeoff.gap_note}}</p><p class="dr-subtle">{{doc.tradeoff.caveat}}</p></template><div v-else class="dr-no-peer"><h4>这次先聚焦一款</h4><p>未选择第二款，或当前没有其他预算内候选。可以在左侧选择同品类产品，继续查看取舍。</p></div></section>
 <section class="dr-section"><div class="dr-section-heading"><span>04</span><h3>预算与报价凭据</h3><small>报价日期与报告日期分别记录</small></div><div class="dr-budget-summary"><div><small>{{doc.budget.label}}</small><strong>{{money(doc.budget.remaining==null?null:Math.abs(doc.budget.remaining))}}</strong></div><div><p>{{doc.budget.note}}</p><small>配件核对：{{doc.budget.accessories}}。费用尚未核实，请计入实际总预算。</small></div></div><div class="dr-quotes"><article v-for="q in doc.quotes" :key="q.product_id"><div class="dr-quote-top"><strong>{{q.name}}</strong><b>{{money(q.amount)}}</b></div><template v-if="q.active"><div class="dr-quote-tags"><span>{{q.price_type}}</span><span>{{q.item_condition==='used'?'二手 · 成色待核对':'全新 · 下单前核对'}}</span><span>{{date(q.observed_at)}} 采集</span></div><p class="dr-variant">{{q.variant}}</p><p class="dr-subtle">{{q.merchant}} · {{q.status}}</p><a v-if="source(q.source_id)" :href="source(q.source_id).url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">[{{q.source_id}}] 查看报价原页 ↗</a><details><summary>查看报价条件与完整采集时间</summary><p>{{q.conditions}}</p><small>{{observed(q.observed_at)}}</small></details></template><template v-else><p>没有满足有效期、地区、库存和配置要求的有效报价，不能确认符合预算。</p><p v-if="q.historical" class="dr-subtle">历史记录：{{money(q.historical.amount)}} · {{date(q.historical.observed_at)}}，仅作资料，不计入本次预算。</p></template></article></div></section>
 <section class="dr-section"><div class="dr-section-heading"><span>05</span><h3>下单前，按这三步确认</h3><small>把建议变成行动</small></div><ol class="dr-checklist"><li v-for="(item,i) in doc.checklist" :key="item.title"><span>{{i+1}}</span><div><h4>{{item.title}}</h4><p>{{item.body}}</p></div></li></ol></section>
 <footer class="dr-footer"><details><summary>来源与资料范围 · {{doc.sources.length}} 条凭据</summary><ul><li v-for="s in doc.sources" :key="s.id"><a :href="s.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">[{{s.id}}] {{s.label}} ↗</a><small>{{s.host}}<template v-if="s.observed_at"> · {{date(s.observed_at)}} 采集</template></small></li></ul><p v-for="line in doc.limitations" :key="line">{{line}}</p></details><p>报告生成于 {{observed(doc.generated_at)}} · 配置、库存与最终支付金额以购买页面为准。</p></footer>
</article>
</template>
